26-10-26T14:45:15Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4910490,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4910490","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:15Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4910490,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4910490","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:15Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4910490,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4910490-1847286114031169","game_id":"steam-4910490","kind":"announcement","title":"Ignite the Depths Demo 1.0.2","summary":"Hey everyone,This patch is mostly about combat.Combat ChangesEnemies will now register hits on players much more consistently. This is largely to prevent circle strafing.Goblin and Skeleton base movement speed has been moderately increased. This is to make kiting a bit more challenging.Some skeletons will now have iron helmets which cannot be hit through.Dev note: All three changes listed above have the goal of making combat against common enemies more engaging. Not necessarily harder. Feedback ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:34:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031169","verified_at":"2026-10-22T06:22:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4910490-1846651706693481","game_id":"steam-4910490","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1.0.1","summary":"Hey everyone,It's been a wild day! I've had fun watching everyone find all the new tidbits and play with the new systems. I've fixed some of the major bugs that have come up as well as some balancing. Fixed an issue where enemies wouldn't swing at a player, and will just do circles.Improved the internal aggro system that controls enemies. Should feel a bit more robust now in co-op situations.Fixed an issue where Priest bow could not hit the orbs from the Skeleton Knight.Fixed an issue where Guar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:44:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693481","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4910490-1846651706678946","game_id":"steam-4910490","kind":"announcement","title":"Ignite the Depths Is Participating in This Months Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone,We're releasing a public demo for this month's Next Fest! We'll be releasing the demo on October 19th at 9:00 AM PST. We'll notify wishlisters via email when we release the demo. There's been a lot of work done since the initial public playtest that I'd like to highlight so you can know what to expect.A Full Loot ExperienceOne of the biggest changes comes from how you interact with progression in the game. Weapons are now loot, with an entire affinity system behind them. Rings are a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T18:40:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678946","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4910490-1843481262702253","game_id":"steam-4910490","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest is Over! What we've learned and what's next.","summary":"Hey everyone,Our playtest has now concluded. So many people joined in and left great feedback for us to dissect and address. I'd like to thank everyone who played and completed our ridiculously large questionnaire. The playtest is just a first public alpha build, with lots of unfinished areas and isn't a polished demo. The full game will have a ton more content, polish, and optimization. I'll be diving deep on some of those topics here. Nevertheless, here are some of the numbers from this weeken","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T16:24:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702253","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4910490-1843481262694361","game_id":"steam-4910490","kind":"update","title":"Ignite the Depths Playtest Patch 1.02","summary":"Hey everyone,I'm patching the demo again with bug fixes and QOL. As well as a ton of balancing regarding parkour and combat in all scenarios. See the patch notes below.Fixed sensitivity not saving when in game.Pyromancer now has a passive mana regeneration along with his mana orbs he gets by attacking enemies with spells.Fixed Skeleton Warrior hitboxes failing when breaking the shield.Increased coyote time for all classes.Fixed some issues with hit registration for all enemies.Buffed Priest's bo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T07:56:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262694361","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4910490-1843481262693560","game_id":"steam-4910490","kind":"update","title":"Ignite the Depths Playtest Patch 1.01","summary":"Hey everyone,I'm dropping a patch that focuses on some of the early feedback we got, as well as some bug fixes. Thank you for all the feedback and reports. It's been overwhelming but it seriously awesome. Skeleton Archer hitbox extendedSkeleton Archer kick nerfed, both speed and damageController sensitivity default to 20%, rather than 1%.Fixed Y axis setting not working. Fixed Skeleton Knight orbs spawning out of boundsFixed an issue that would cause the game not to load after everyone readied u","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T22:36:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262693560","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4910490-1843481262692146","game_id":"steam-4910490","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest available now!","summary":"Hey everyone,Our playtest is now available to everyone who wants to hop in!This is an early version of what's to come, so expect missing features and bugs. Filling out feedback helps us a ton so we appreciate everyone who does. As the day goes on today, expect hotfixes for the things you're reporting. There will also be a surprise in the coming days... We hope you all have fun, even if you encounter some bugs,Marcus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T13:03:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692146","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4910490-1842212951297675","game_id":"steam-4910490","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Pushed Back to September 10th-14th!","summary":"Hey everyone,We're pushing back our playtest date by just a week, meaning we're going to start on September 10th now. This is mostly about having a bit more polish than initially planned, as we're going to have a lot more people than expected have their hands on it. We can't wait for you all to get in, and we look forward to seeing you all there!You can sign up for the playtest on our store page, and we'll get you in on the day of. You can also join our Discord and Wishlist the game here. Thank ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T17:27:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297675","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4910490-1840944183774945","game_id":"steam-4910490","kind":"announcement","title":"100k Wishlists + Playtest Date Reveal!!","summary":"Hey everyone,We are stoked to announce that Ignite the Depths has already surpassed 100,000 wishlists! That is hard to even type out, and we cannot thank you all enough. That is way past expectations and we are thrilled to bring this game to all of you. To celebrate this milestone, we're announcing our first playtest date. Which will be September 3rd-7th. This will be a small slice of the full game and a way for us to get feedback and fix all the bugs you'll inevitably find. You'll get in on the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T20:20:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774945","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4910490-1839041357038988","game_id":"steam-4910